msgid "A customer or agent says they were never told about a ticket or a reply. The ticket itself is fine — the message about it did not arrive."
msgstr ""

#: includes/classes/docs.php:87
msgid "Send a test message from Email Health. If it fails here, nothing else on this page matters — WordPress itself cannot send mail on this site."
